              "locked": false,
              "content": {
                "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Any information you choose to share will be treated confidentially.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">If you are invited to discuss your experience further or contribute to future patient education resources, this will only take place with your agreement.</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Participation is entirely voluntary.</span></p></li></ul><p></p>",
